7,Kuuk-Yak - docs.verbix.com,https://docs.verbix.com/EndangeredLanguages/KuukYak,"Kuuk-Yak language information Facts Language: Kuuk-Yak Alternate names: Kuuk Yak, Koko Yak, Kuku Yak Language code: uky Language family: Australian, Pama-Nyungan, Paman, Southwestern Pama (SIL classification) Number of speakers: No known L1 speakers. Vulnerability: Dormant Script: Unwritten.",Kuuk-Yak,Australian
