9,AIATSIS AustLang Online,https://aiatsis.gov.au/austlang/language/y200,"According to Alpher (1972) and Gaby (2006), Kuku Yak and Thayore Y69 are closely related. Alpher's later studies of Kuuk-Yak (2006 p.c.) concludes that they are in fact not closely related.",Kuuk-Yak,Australian
